{'symbol': 'PPG', 'date': '2021-10-06 09:50:00', 'title': 'PPG COMEX BRAND LAUNCHES VINIMEX TOTAL ANTIVIRAL AND ANTIBACTERIAL PAINT', 'text': "MEXICO CITY--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE COMEX® BRAND BY PPG (NYSE:PPG) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT RECENTLY LAUNCHED COMEX VINIMEX® TOTAL ANTIVIRAL AND ANTIBACTERIAL PAINT. THE NEW PRODUCT REDUCES UP TO 99.9% OF BACTERIA AND VIRUSES RESPONSIBLE FOR THE MOST COMMON GASTROINTESTINAL AND RESPIRATORY ILLNESSES, INCLUDING INFLUENZA A H1N1 AND THE COVID-19 VIRUS, SARS-COV-2. WITH THE SUPPORT OF PPG'S GLOBAL RESEARCH NETWORK, THE BRAND ADDED ANTIVIRAL CAPABILITIES TO ITS EXISTING COMEX VINIMEX TOTAL ANTIBACTERIAL PA"}